      "value": "It is quiet hard for use IRL I believe.\nNot everyone use same environment and hardware.\nLike 1 use headphone while others use normal integrated speaker if they use Valve Index headset and it would be different feel of volume as there would be outside factor like PC volume and headphone setting and more.\nSo usually display reference value at spawn of worlds works better.",
